omponents within coffee contribute significantly to liver health.\\n\\n**Coffee’s Broader Health Impacts**\\n\\nBeyond its impact on liver disease, coffee consumption is also associated with a reduced risk of chronic diseases in general. Research published earlier this year linked regular coffee intake to increased longevity and better overall health outcomes. These findings highlight the potential role of coffee as part of a healthy lifestyle, offering benefits beyond just liver protection.\\n\\nIn conclusion, while more research is needed to fully understand all mechanisms behind these effects, current evidence strongly supports the notion that drinking five or more cups of coffee daily may offer substantial protective benefits for the liver, including reducing the risks of cancer and cirrhosis.\",\n  \"claim_to_source\": [\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Drinking five or more cups of coffee daily reduces the risk of liver cancer by up to 47%.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\"source:a7913420ce41258bbbdcaf44d19e60bd25480f463d03a153cefa4a43f1f22116:662ecbbf-c771-4650-a668-4660f0f70d13:1\", \"source:a7913420ce41258bbbdcaf44d19e60bd25480f463d03a153cefa4a43f1f22116:662ecbbf-c771-4650-a668-4660f0f70d13:2\", \"source:a7913420ce41258bbbdcaf44d19e60bd25480f463d03a153cefa4a43f1f22116:662ecbbf-c771-4650-a668-4660f0f70d13:3\", \"source:a7913420ce41258bbbdcaf44d19e60bd25480f463d03a153cefa4a43f1f22116:662ecbbf-c771-4650-a668-4660f0f70d13:4\", \"source:a7913420ce41258bbbdcaf44d19e60bd25480f463d03a153cefa4a43f1f22116:662ecbbf-c771-4650-a668-4660f0f70d13:5\", \"source:a7913420ce41258bbbdcaf44d19e60bd25480f463d03a153cefa4a43f1f22116:662ecbbf-c771-4650-a668-4660f0f70d13:6\", \"source:a7913420ce41258bbbdcaf44d19e60bd25480f463d03a153cefa4a43f1f22116:662ecbbf-c771-4650-a668-4660f0f70d13:7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Decaffeinated coffee provides nearly the same liver protection as regular coffee.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\"source:a7913420ce41258bbbdcaf44d19e60bd25480f463d03a153cefa4