+  "raw_response": "{\"headline\":\"Moonshot AI Unveils Kimi K3, a 2.8-Trillion-Parameter Open-Weight Model with Native Vision and Reasoning Capabilities\",\"dek\":\"The model is available for download on Hugging Face and offers day-0 hosting access through Together AI and Modal.\",\"body_markdown\":\"### Moonshot AI Releases Kimi K3\\nOn July 16, 2026, Moonshot AI publicly released **Kimi K3**, an open-weight model containing **2.8 trillion parameters**. The full weights were made available by July 27, as promised in the source.\\n\\n### Key Features of Kimi K3\\n- **Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) Architecture**: This design allows efficient management of its large parameter count by activating only necessary components per token.\\n- **Native Vision Support**: Kimi K3 is capable of processing visual data natively.\\n- **Context Length**: It supports a context length of up to **1 million tokens**, enabling it to handle extremely long sequences of text or other input types.\\n- **Reasoning Mode**: An always-on 'thinking mode' enhances reasoning capabilities for complex tasks.\\n\\n### Open Source and Hosting Access\\nKimi K3 was made available on Hugging Face with full weights, code, and technical reports. Additionally, **Together AI** and **Modal** provided day-0 hosting access shortly after its release, as confirmed by the source.\\n\\n### Competitive Positioning\\nMoonshot AI has positioned Kimi K3 to compete directly with models such as **Claude Fable 5** and **GPT-5.6 Sol**, reporting benchmark results that surpass those of **Claude Opus 4.8** and **GPT-5.5** in certain areas.\\n\\n### Independent Benchmark Performance\\nIn an independent evaluation conducted by Artificial Analysis, Kimi K3 ranked **fourth out of 189 tested models** on its Intelligence Index, highlighting its strong performance across a range of tasks.\\n\\n### Pricing Information\\nAccording to the official API documentation from platform.kimi.ai:\\n- **Input Token Cost**: $3 per million input tokens\\n- **Output Token Cost**: $15 per million output tokens\\n\\nThis pricing model reflects the computational intensity required for such a large-scale model while making it accessible for research and development purposes.\",\"claim_to_source\": [{\"claim\":\"Moonshot AI released the open-weight model Kimi K3 with 2.8 trillion parameters on July 16, 2026.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:4\",\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:11\"]},{\"claim\":\"Kimi K3 is an autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) transformer with native vision support and a context length of 1 million tokens.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:4\"]},{\"claim\":\"Moonshot AI released Kimi K3, a 2.8-trillion-parameter open-weight model on Hugging Face.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:5\"]},{\"claim\":\"Kimi K3 uses Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) design to manage its large parameter count efficiently.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:5\"]},{\"claim\":\"Moonshot AI unveiled a new AI model called Kimi K3 with 2.8 trillion parameters.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:6\"]},{\"claim\":\"Kimi K3 will be released as an open-source model on 27 July.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:6\"]},{\"claim\":\"Kimi K3 is a 2.8-trillion-parameter open-weight model from Moonshot AI released on July 16, 2026.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b8