ut tokens\\n- **Output Token Cost**: $15 per million output tokens\\n\\nThis pricing model reflects the computational intensity required for such a large-scale model while making it accessible for research and development purposes.\",\"claim_to_source\": [{\"claim\":\"Moonshot AI released the open-weight model Kimi K3 with 2.8 trillion parameters on July 16, 2026.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:4\",\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:11\"]},{\"claim\":\"Kimi K3 is an autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) transformer with native vision support and a context length of 1 million tokens.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:4\"]},{\"claim\":\"Moonshot AI released Kimi K3, a 2.8-trillion-parameter open-weight model on Hugging Face.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:5\"]},{\"claim\":\"Kimi K3 uses Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) design to manage its large parameter count efficiently.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:5\"]},{\"claim\":\"Moonshot AI unveiled a new AI model called Kimi K3 with 2.8 trillion parameters.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:6\"]},{\"claim\":\"Kimi K3 will be released as an open-source model on 27 July.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:6\"]},{\"claim\":\"Kimi K3 is a 2.8-trillion-parameter open-weight model from Moonshot AI released on July 16, 2026.\",\"source_ids\":[\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973