+          "raw_response": "{\n  \"headline\": \"Moonshot AI Unveils Kimi K3, the World's Largest Open-Weight Model with 2.8 Trillion Parameters\",\n  \"dek\": \"On July 16, 2026, Moonshot AI made history by publicly releasing Kimi K3, an open-source model with 2.8 trillion parameters and native vision support.\",\n  \"body_markdown\": \"# Moonshot AI Unveils Kimi K3: The World’s Largest Open-Weight Model\\n\\n## Introduction\\n\\nIn a groundbreaking move on **July 16, 2026**, Moonshot AI officially launched **Kimi K3**, a new large language model (LLM) that has already captured the attention of researchers, developers, and industry leaders worldwide. With **2.8 trillion parameters**—the largest parameter count ever seen in any open-weight LLM—and advanced features such as **native vision support**, **a one-million-token context window**, and an always-on 'thinking mode' for reasoning, Kimi K3 is poised to redefine what's possible with artificial intelligence.\\n\\nMoonshot AI promised full open-source weights by **July 27, 2026**, marking this release as not only a technological milestone but also a significant step toward democratizing access to cutting-edge AI models. The model was made available on platforms like Hugging Face, with day-0 hosting provided by Together AI and Modal shortly after its launch, ensuring immediate accessibility for developers around the globe.\\n\\n## Key Features of Kimi K3\\n### 1. Massive Parameter Count: 2.8 Trillion Parameters\\nKimi K3 stands out due to its unprecedented scale—**2.8 trillion parameters**, which is significantly larger than any previously released open-weight LLMs. This massive parameter count allows the model to capture more complex patterns in data, leading to improved performance across a wide range of tasks such as coding, knowledge work, reasoning, and even creative writing. The sheer size of the model also enables it to handle highly specialized domains with greater accuracy and fluency.\\n\\n### 2. Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) Architecture for Efficiency\\nTo manage this enormous number of parameters efficiently, Kimi K3 employs a **Mixture-of-Experts (MoE)** design. MoE splits the total set of parameters into multiple 'expert' sub-models that are activated only when needed based on input tokens. This approach ensures computational efficiency without sacrificing performance, making Kimi K3 both powerful and scalable in real-world applications.\\n\\n### 3. Native Vision Support\\nKimi K3 is not limited to text-based tasks—it also includes **native vision support**, allowing it to process and understand visual data directly within its architecture. This capability opens up new possibilities for AI-powered image recognition, object detection, and even multimodal reasoning where text and images can be analyzed together seamlessly.\\n\\n### 4. One-Million-Token Context Window\\nWith a context window of **1 million tokens**, Kimi K3 surpasses the limitations of previous models that typically had much smaller context lengths (e.g., GPT-3 with only 2048 tokens). A larger context window means the model can handle longer documents, complex conversations, or extended sequences without losing coherence or accuracy—making it ideal for tasks like legal document analysis, long-form content generation, and more.\\n\\n### 5. Always-On 'Thinking Mode' for Reasoning\\nKimi K3 includes an always-on 'thinking mode,' which enhances its reasoning capabilities by allowing deeper introspection during inference. This feature is particularly useful in scenarios requiring logical deduction, problem-solving, or multi-step planning, where traditional models might struggle to maintain consistency over time.\\n\\n## Open Source Release and Accessibility\\nMoonshot AI has made Kimi K3 fully open-source with **free public weights**, ensuring that researchers, developers, and organizations can access the model without restrictions. The full weights were released on **July 26, 2026**, a day ahead of the originally planned July 27 target, as confirmed by Together AI and Modal, who provided immediate hosting support for the model.\\n\\nThe release includes not only the model weights but also accompanying code, technical reports, and documentation—making it easier than ever before for users to integrate Kimi K3 into their workflows or customize it further if needed. This level of openness is expected to accelerate innovation in both academic research and industry applications across various domains.\\n\\n## Competitive Positioning: Benchmark Results and Industry Impact\\nKimi K3 has been positioned as Moonshot AI's most capable model yet, with benchmark results that place it **ahead of models like Claude Fable 5** and **GPT-5.6 Sol**, according to internal evaluations by Moonshot AI. An independent evaluation conducted by Artificial Analysis ranked Kimi K3 **fourth out of 189 tested models on its Intelligence Index**, highlighting its strong performance relative to other leading LLMs at the time of release.\\n\\nThis competitive edge is expected to have a significant impact on industries relying heavily on large language models for tasks such as customer service automation, content creation, data analysis, and more. By offering an open-source alternative with superior capabilities compared to some closed-weight competitors, Moonshot AI has positioned itself as a major player in the global AI landscape.\\n\\n## Conclusion: A New Era for Open-Source AI Models\\nThe launch of Kimi K3 marks a pivotal moment in the evolution of artificial intelligence—particularly in terms of accessibility and scalability. With **2.8 trillion parameters**, native vision support, a one-million-token context window, MoE architecture, and full open-source availability, Kimi K3 sets a new standard for what is possible with large language models today.\\n\\nAs developers begin exploring its potential applications across various industries—from healthcare and education to finance and entertainment—the impact of this release will likely be felt globally over time. Moonshot AI's commitment to making such powerful tools freely available underscores their belief that innovation thrives when knowledge is shared openly among researchers and practitioners alike.\\n\\nIn summary, the unveiling of Kimi K3 represents not just another advancement in AI technology but also an important step toward democratizing access to high-performance machine learning systems worldwide.\",\n  \"claim_to_source\": [\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Moonshot AI publicly released Kimi K3 on July 16, 2026.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:4\", \"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:11\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Kimi K3 is an autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) transformer with native vision support and a context length of 1 million tokens.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Moonshot AI released Kimi K3, a 2.8-trillion-parameter open-weight model on Hugging Face.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Kimi K3 uses Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) design to manage its large parameter count efficiently.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Moonshot AI unveiled a new AI model called Kimi K3 with 2.8 trillion parameters.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\"source:b395ad32601b08c390b2c1b785c9b579e9422c75973ce4d33b851e1c20ad93d0:6c9d6bfd-2ce7-4638-8d81-58e4dc257511:6\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Kimi K3 w